<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - D.R. Horton initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - D.R. Horton initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Ivy Schneider said she initiated coverage of D.R. Horton Inc with a buy rating, citing the company's &quot;outstanding track record, continued positive new order comparisons, and its attractive valuation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- She said that for its third quarter ended June 30, 1996, new orders increased 42 percent compared with negative comparisons for most builders. She said fourth quarter new orders should increase in the low double digits.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 9-3/4.</p>
</text>
